1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,583
Good morning! Today, I am taking the train.

2
00:00:04,583 --> 00:00:09,167
I am going to visit my sister, Anna.

3
00:00:09,167 --> 00:00:13,750
She lives in a town called Greenfield.

4
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:18,333
My train leaves at ten thirty this morning.

5
00:00:18,333 --> 00:00:22,917
It is nine o'clock now. I have time.

6
00:00:22,917 --> 00:00:27,500
First, I need my phone and my wallet.

7
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:32,083
Here are the train times on my phone.

8
00:00:32,083 --> 00:00:36,667
Oh! I almost forgot my water bottle.

9
00:00:36,667 --> 00:00:41,250
I will put it inside my small bag.

10
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:45,833
My sister said, please arrive before lunch.

11
00:00:45,833 --> 00:00:50,417
I hope the train will be on time.

12
00:00:50,417 --> 00:00:55,000
All right. I am ready. Let's go!
